From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <daryldenson0405@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] husky: add an Extreme Charging (BODEGA) charge-thermal
 profile

Evolution X's ExtremeChargingController (frameworks/base) enables the
Extreme Charging tile when IPowerExt.isModeSupported("BODEGA") is true.
On husky the Pixel power HAL has no BODEGA hint, so the tile stays
hidden and wired charging is held to the stock screen-on limits: the
VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-WIRED PID starts cutting current (chg_mdis) at a
38 C virtual skin temperature.

Add the hint, modelled on the Pixel 11 stock one but more conservative:
- powerhint.json: BODEGA sets vendor.thermal.VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-{WIRED,
  PERSIST}.profile to "bodega" (power HAL already holds
  set_prop(vendor_thermal_prop); ResetOnInit clears it after a crash).
- thermal_info_config_charge.json: a "bodega" profile per sensor. Stock
  Pixel 11 disables the chg_mdis binding outright; here the PID ceiling
  drops from 25 to 8 below 45 C and the WIRED state-1 hard limit moves
  from 38 C to 45 C. The 47 C/55 C cut-offs, USB-port throttling, the
  battery's 60 C trip and google-battery's own temperature limits are
  untouched. The profile's BindedCdevInfo is complete because the HAL
  parses a profile's bindings from scratch, not as a delta.

The controller only engages it while plugged in at or below 50% and
turns it off when unplugged or full.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 proprietary/vendor/etc/powerhint.json         | 34 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../etc/thermal_info_config_charge.json       | 30 ++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 64 insertions(+)

diff --git a/proprietary/vendor/etc/powerhint.json b/proprietary/vendor/etc/powerhint.json
index 790f9572..d46e483f 100644
--- a/proprietary/vendor/etc/powerhint.json
+++ b/proprietary/vendor/etc/powerhint.json
@@ -965,6 +965,28 @@
       "ResetOnInit": true,
       "Type": "Property"
     },
+    {
+      "Name": "VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-WIRED",
+      "Path": "vendor.thermal.VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-WIRED.profile",
+      "Values": [
+        "",
+        "bodega"
+      ],
+      "DefaultIndex": 0,
+      "ResetOnInit": true,
+      "Type": "Property"
+    },
+    {
+      "Name": "VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-PERSIST",
+      "Path": "vendor.thermal.VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-PERSIST.profile",
+      "Values": [
+        "",
+        "bodega"
+      ],
+      "DefaultIndex": 0,
+      "ResetOnInit": true,
+      "Type": "Property"
+    },
     {
       "Name": "MIFTargetLoad",
       "Path": "/sys/class/devfreq/17000010.devfreq_mif/interactive/target_load",
@@ -3252,6 +3274,18 @@
       "Duration": 0,
       "Value": "game"
     },
+    {
+      "PowerHint": "BODEGA",
+      "Node": "VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-WIRED",
+      "Duration": 0,
+      "Value": "bodega"
+    },
+    {
+      "PowerHint": "BODEGA",
+      "Node": "VIRTUAL-SKIN-CHARGE-PERSIST",
+      "Duration": 0,
+      "Value": "bodega"
+    },
     {
       "PowerHint": "GAME",
       "Node": "CPUDVFSHeadroom",
diff --git a/proprietary/vendor/etc/thermal_info_config_charge.json b/proprietary/vendor/etc/thermal_info_config_charge.json
index ee24971a..8b98214f 100644
--- a/proprietary/vendor/etc/thermal_info_config_charge.json
+++ b/proprietary/vendor/etc/thermal_info_config_charge.json
@@ -194,6 +194,21 @@
                     "CdevCeiling": [0, 25, 25, 25, 26, 26, 26],
                     "LimitInfo": [0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 26, 26]
                 }
+            ],
+            "Profile": [
+                {
+                    "Mode": "bodega",
+                    "BindedCdevInfo": [
+                        {
+                            "CdevRequest": "chg_mdis",
+                            "CdevWeightForPID": [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1],
+                            "MaxReleaseStep": 1,
+                            "MaxThrottleStep": 1,
+                            "CdevCeiling": [0, 8, 8, 8, 26, 26, 26],
+                            "LimitInfo": [0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 26, 26]
+                        }
+                    ]
+                }
             ]
         },
         {
@@ -237,6 +252,21 @@
                     "CdevCeiling": [0, 25, 25, 26, 26, 26, 26],
                     "LimitInfo": [0, 0, 1, 1, 26, 26, 26]
                 }
+            ],
+            "Profile": [
+                {
+                    "Mode": "bodega",
+                    "BindedCdevInfo": [
+                        {
+                            "CdevRequest": "chg_mdis",
+                            "CdevWeightForPID": [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1],
+                            "MaxReleaseStep": 1,
+                            "MaxThrottleStep": 1,
+                            "CdevCeiling": [0, 8, 8, 26, 26, 26, 26],
+                            "LimitInfo": [0, 0, 1, 1, 26, 26, 26]
+                        }
+                    ]
+                }
             ]
         },
         {
